<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The same test suite as crypto_test_1, run against crypto_lib instead of
  crypto_fast.

  Two differences from crypto_test_1 that are not just a swapped include path:

    - No Argon2 sources here. crypto_fast leaves Argon2 to whoever links it, so
      crypto_test_1 compiles crypto\Argon2\*.c itself; crypto_lib builds its own
      copy into the library, and compiling a second set would collide.

    - No Win32. crypto_lib is amd64 and ARM64 only - aes_asm.h says so with an
      #error - because there is no 32-bit x86 AES core in it.

  CL_ENABLE_AVX / CL_ENABLE_AVX2 match what crypto_lib.vcxproj is built with, so
  that the availability probes crypto_tests.c calls are declared here too.
-->
